OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F319A1786882712
OL,3,C'We will teach Saudi Arabia a lesson':
OL,4,CHouthis threaten shipping attacks
OL,6,FIn an interview with ITV News, a
OL,7,Fsenior official for the Iran-backed
OL,8,Frebel group said it would intensify
OL,9,Fattacks around the Bab al-Mandab
OL,10,FStrait, the narrow waterway between
OL,11,FYemen and the Horn of Africa through
OL,12,Fwhich ships pass between the Red Sea
OL,13,Fand the Gulf of Aden.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/15
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
