OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F319A1786882712
OL,3,C'We will teach Saudi Arabia a lesson':
OL,4,CHouthis threaten shipping attacks
OL,6,F"We will teach Saudi Arabia a lesson,"
OL,7,Fsaid Mohammed al-Bukhaiti, a senior
OL,8,Fpolitical official for the movement,
OL,9,Fthreatening what he described as a
OL,10,Fblockade. "The blockade will continue
OL,11,Fto intensify until all Saudi ports and
OL,12,Fairports have been successfully
OL,13,Fclosed."
OL,15,FAs flames lit up the Red Sea coast on
OL,16,FFriday night, it became clear that the
OL,17,FHouthis were intensifying their
OL,18,Fcampaign.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/15
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
