OL,3,C'We will teach Saudi Arabia a lesson':
OL,4,CHouthis threaten shipping attacks
OL,6,FThey targeted the port city of Mokha
OL,7,Fin western Yemen with six ballistic
OL,8,Fmissiles, Yemen's internationally
OL,9,Frecognised government army media said
OL,10,Fin a statement.
OL,12,FThe ballistic missile strikes killed
OL,13,Fone person and wounded eight others,
OL,14,Faccording to the Media Office of Taiz
OL,15,Fprovince, citing the Taiz Health
OL,16,FOperations Room.
OL,18,FInjured people, including children,
OL,19,Fwere seen being treated at a hospital
OL,20,Fin the city after the attack.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/15
