OL,3,C'We will teach Saudi Arabia a lesson':
OL,4,CHouthis threaten shipping attacks
OL,6,FMeanwhile, at least six people were
OL,7,Fkilled on Tuesday by Houthi missiles
OL,8,Ffired on a vessel in the strait.
OL,10,FThe attack on the Egyptian-owned ship
OL,11,Fled to the first shipping deaths
OL,12,Flinked to the group since the start of
OL,13,Fthe United States and Israel's war on
OL,14,FIran in February. The Houthis say they
OL,15,Fstruck the ship because it has links
OL,16,Fto Saudi Arabia.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/15
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
