OL,3,C'We will teach Saudi Arabia a lesson':
OL,4,CHouthis threaten shipping attacks
OL,6,FFraming the group as the saviours of
OL,7,Fmaritime access rather than a threat
OL,8,Fto it, al-Bukraiti said the group
OL,9,Fwould limit its attacks to Saudi ships
OL,10,Fas well as other vessels supporting
OL,11,FSaudi operations. But he said they
OL,12,Fwould maintain hostility towards other
OL,13,Fcountries.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/15
