OL,3,C'We will teach Saudi Arabia a lesson':
OL,4,CHouthis threaten shipping attacks
OL,6,F"As for navigation in the Red Sea, our
OL,7,Fposition is that freedom of maritime
OL,8,Fnavigation through the Bab al-Mandab
OL,9,FStrait and the Red Sea is a right for
OL,10,Fall countries of the world. We are
OL,11,Fcommitted to protecting freedom of
OL,12,Fnavigation in Bab al-Mandab and the
OL,13,FRed Sea.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/15
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
