OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F319A1786882712
OL,3,C'We will teach Saudi Arabia a lesson':
OL,4,CHouthis threaten shipping attacks
OL,6,F"We present this position through the
OL,7,Flanguage of reason. But the problem is
OL,8,Fthat the four countries involved in
OL,9,Fthe aggression, the United States,
OL,10,FBritain, Saudi Arabia and the UAE,
OL,11,Fhave deprived Yemen of its right to
OL,12,Fmaritime navigation through Bab al-
OL,13,FMandab and the Red Sea. That goes
OL,14,Fagainst reason."
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G8/15
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
