OL,3,C'We will teach Saudi Arabia a lesson':
OL,4,CHouthis threaten shipping attacks
OL,6,FThe Houthis say they are retaliating
OL,7,Fagainst Saudi Arabia, which supports
OL,8,FYemen's internationally recognised
OL,9,Fgovernment, after a Saudi airstrike
OL,10,Fdamaged the runway at Sana'a airport,
OL,11,Fin the Houthi-controlled capital in
OL,12,FJuly.
OL,14,FThe attack followed a dispute over
OL,15,Fwhich aircraft could be used by the
OL,16,FHouthi delegation returning from the
OL,17,Ffuneral of the late supreme leader of
OL,18,FIran, Ayatollah Ali Khamenei. The
OL,19,FHouthis have previously said they were
OL,20,Frefused clearance from the Saudi-led
OL,21,Fcoalition.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G9/15
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,320,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31910
SC,0010
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F319A1786882712
OL,3,C'We will teach Saudi Arabia a lesson':
OL,4,CHouthis threaten shipping attacks
OL,6,FBut in an interview with ITV News,
OL,7,Fthey confirmed they were offered a
OL,8,Fcompromise by officials from the
OL,9,FYemeni government - safe passage if
OL,10,Fthey flew with a non-Iranian carrier.
OL,11,FSaudi officials said that the official
OL,12,Fgovernment of Yemen thought that would
OL,13,Fsignificantly reduce the risk of the
OL,14,Fflight being used to transfer Iranian
OL,15,Fequipment to the Houthis.
OL,17,FThe Houthis deny turning down the
OL,18,Foffer because they were searching for
OL,19,Fa pretext to resume the war. They said
OL,20,Fthey were acting on a point of
OL,21,Fprinciple.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G10/15
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
