PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F319A1786882712
OL,3,C'We will teach Saudi Arabia a lesson':
OL,4,CHouthis threaten shipping attacks
OL,6,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
OL,7,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,8,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,9,Finbox every Friday morning.
OL,11,F"I was part of that Yemeni delegation,
OL,12,Fand I was one of those who wanted to
OL,13,Freturn to Yemen," said al-Bukhaiti.
OL,15,F"But that is not our issue. Our issue
OL,16,Fis the unjust blockade imposed on
OL,17,FYemen, which has caused the deaths of
OL,18,Fmillions of Yemenis. It is not simply
OL,19,Fabout the return of 250 Yemeni
OL,20,Fcitizens to Yemen on that flight.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G11/15
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,320,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31912
SC,0012
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F319A1786882712
OL,3,C'We will teach Saudi Arabia a lesson':
OL,4,CHouthis threaten shipping attacks
OL,6,F"The problem is not whether or not a
OL,7,FYemeni delegation is permitted to
OL,8,Fattend Ayatollah Ali Khamenei's
OL,9,Fburial; rather, it is that Saudi
OL,10,FArabia prohibits commercial flights to
OL,11,Fand from Sana'a Airport, and maritime
OL,12,Fvessels to and from Yemen. Neither
OL,13,FSaudi Arabia nor any other nation
OL,14,Fshould have the authority to do so.
OL,15,FOur primary problem is this."
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G12/15
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,320,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31913
SC,0013
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F319A1786882712
OL,3,C'We will teach Saudi Arabia a lesson':
OL,4,CHouthis threaten shipping attacks
OL,6,FBy taking their retaliation to one of
OL,7,Fthe world's most important shipping
OL,8,Froutes, the Houthis risk turning a
OL,9,Fconfrontation with Saudi Arabia into a
OL,10,Fcrisis with consequences far beyond
OL,11,FYemen.
OL,13,F"We are merely practising our right to
OL,14,Fself-defence, as we are dealing with
OL,15,Faggression by aggression and siege by
OL,16,Fsiege," said al-Bukhaiti. "And when
OL,17,FSaudi Arabia declares its will to end
OL,18,Fthis aggression and the blockade, we
OL,19,Fwill promptly do the same.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G13/15
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,320,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31914
SC,0014
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F319A1786882712
OL,3,C'We will teach Saudi Arabia a lesson':
OL,4,CHouthis threaten shipping attacks
OL,6,F"We will teach Saudi Arabia a lesson,
OL,7,Fand we will apply a similar blockade.
OL,8,FAnd the blockade will continue to
OL,9,Fintensify until all Saudi ports and
OL,10,Fairports have been successfully
OL,11,Fclosed. And any nation getting
OL,12,Fthemselves involved and supporting
OL,13,FSaudi Arabia, whether it be the United
OL,14,FStates or the United Kingdom or
OL,15,Fwhomever, will be facing the
OL,16,Fconsequences. We will teach them a
OL,17,Flesson by targeting them and besieging
OL,18,Fthem."
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G14/15
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
